427 0 obj<</CreationDate(D:20161024165111+05'30')/Subtype/FreeText/AP<</N 428 0 R>>/Subj(Text Box)/T(dvbelvalkar)/P 14 0 R/Rect[61.9765 55.64656 535.5952 125.6945]/M(D:20170426093531+05'30')/DS(font: Helvetica 10pt; text-align:left; margin:0pt; line-height:11.5pt; color:#FF0000)/Type/Annot/RD[10.43375 10.44708 10.43359 10.44869]/RC(<?xml version="1.0"?><body xmlns:xfa="http://www.xfa.org/schema/xfa-data/1.0/" xfa:contentType="text/html" xfa:APIVersion="BluebeamPDFRevu:2016" xfa:spec="2.2.0" style="font:Helvetica 10pt; text-align:left; margin:0pt; line-height:11.5pt; color:#FF0000" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><p>10.6                  The rotor shall be of squirrel cage type, dynamically balanced to provide a low </p><p>                         vibration <span>level and long service life for the bearings. </span><span><span><span>Die cast aluminum rotors for </span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span>                         motors in hazardous areas may </span><span><span>be accepted provided the same are type tested and </span></span></span></span></p><p><span><span><span><span>                         approved by competent </span></span></span></span><span><span><span>authorities.</span></span></span></p></body>)/F 4/C[1 1 1]/Contents<>/BS<</W 1/Type/Border/S/S>>/DA(1 0 0 rg /Helv 10 Tf)/NM(RGEDKCBFBRLBWWAQ)/BE<</I 1/S/C>>>>
